Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Getsuga...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang perlu kita bicarakan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa pun yang terjadi kali ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tidak akan terkejut lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu masih hidup, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja dia aman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melindungi manusia...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di depan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wakil Kapten Okikiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus lindungi mereka\Ndan bertahan hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa pun yang terjadi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal pihak sana hanya sendirian,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku merasa seperti kita yang kalah jumlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan mati
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebelum dunia ini hancur!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keparat itu benar-benar menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial! Aku tidak bisa mendekat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah tertawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya teringat masa lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daripada itu, aku punya strategi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serang aku dengan Getsuga terkuatmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan bukakan jalan\Nsupaya kamu bisa mendekatinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Getsuga Tensho!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maju.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalah jumlah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bukan alasan untuk mundur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena kita adalah Gotei 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengirim Pasukan Rahasia sebagai garda depan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak heran bila kita jadi\Nbahan cemoohan generasi mendatang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shunko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cascada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shukei: Hakuteiken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mati kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak kena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:06:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betapa fananya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jatuhlah kau.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa kau rasakan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasa sakit itulah tanda kehidupan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, inilah kematian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segalanya akan terkalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segalanya akan berpadu,\Nmenjadi masa depan yang kudambakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ishida!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Ichigo. Hal yang tersisa\Npada dirimu saat ini
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hanyalah ketakutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Celaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shino!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatanku akan segera menyelimuti\Nlangit dari ketiga dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segala hal di dunia ini
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kembali ke ketiadaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selangkah lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu terjerumus ke dalam lautan darah\Ndunia yang tak terhindarkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika langit ketiga dunia
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terpengaruh oleh kekuatan hitam...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia... akan hancur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pikir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang akan para kapten\Ndan Urahara Kisuke lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang bisa kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski harus mempertaruhkan nyawa,\Naku akan tetap lindungi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, itu baru seorang shinigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita juga tidak boleh kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita mulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ishida, kamu diam saja sejak tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba lihat cermin dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suaramu juga terdengar lesu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Kita harus apa sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibiarkan saja,\Ndunia akan benar-benar hancur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru kali ini aku mendengarmu begitu putus asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah itu yang terdengar seperti kiamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengarkan aku, Kurosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Milikku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Harapan" terakhir kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika menembaknya dengan mata panah ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita bisa melenyapkan kekuatan Yhwach
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}meski hanya sekejap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu punya itu, kenapa tidak...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa hanya kena tubuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Supaya bercampur dengan darahnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harus kena jantung...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, oke. Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, aku harus apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buat Yhwach lengah sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ransotengai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita mulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ichigo masih bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua masih bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keputusasaan tak bisa dihitung pakai persen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jauh lebih baik jika kita berjuang\Nsampai titik darah penghabisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin melemparkan Hollow ke arah keparat itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba lempar saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang kau kira mati, hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kita musnahkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang akan musnahkan dia duluan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangat, Nona Haribel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangat, semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah... Langitnya hampir tertutup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar terasa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seperti akhir dunia, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setuju.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kejadiannya cepat sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurosaki sedang bertarung\Nuntuk melindungi dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kita harus lindungi\Ntempat untuknya kembali!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari lakukan yang kita bisa dengan sekuat tenaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langitnya sudah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal yang ingin kamu lindungi\Nukurannya selalu besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tidak akan sempat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langitnya akan ditelan kegelapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya, biarkan aku ikut membantumu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memikul beban seberat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lemparkan Nell ke sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lempar Nell ke langit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:13:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seppa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadilah pasir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iba...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mantap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu berhenti. Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Laporkan situasinya. Sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}576 Hollow mendekat ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlahnya berkurang drastis\Nakibat serangan yang hitam itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibiarkan, saat mereka sampai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak butuh tebakan atau prediksi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teruskan menyebar umpan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita hanya perlu memancing lebih banyak Hollow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana modifikasi amplifikasinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:14:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuh puluh tujuh persen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan bunuh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:15:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Grimmjow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan aku dan selamatkan Hueco Mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ginjo, kamu sadar, tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.47,0:16:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sedang bertarung untuk shinigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya merasa semuanya percuma
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jika mereka tidak ada saat Ichigo kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Aku anggap seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan melawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu hanya perlu menunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu waktu yang tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bankai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jakuho Raikoben!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk kali ini,\Naku berterima kasih pada Bankai ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang sebenarnya menggerakkan kalian...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah tahu jawabannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal yang ada di atas pedang kami
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah kewajiban.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyebalkan sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa juga yang mau mengikuti perkataanmu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hancurkan semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak kena.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku melihat itu, Uryuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlah Hollow-nya 74 ekor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka telah terpancing\Ndi depan mesin amplifikasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Modifikasi sudah 100 persen rampung.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sasaran terkunci, Yhwach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami siap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tembak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlah daya berkurang menjadi 68 persen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ia mengarah ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, sedang apa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal seperti ini
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bukan lagi soal logika.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tekad kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya percuma saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:20:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktunya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}telah tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Waktu" untuk akhir dari segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketiga dunia telah menyatu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan muncul di tempat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang keparat itu\Nlakukan pada tubuhku?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hollow rendahan...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tertangkap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lengan kanan Raja Jiwa telah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu adalah lengan kanan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.21,0:23:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah alasan aku bertahan hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.76,0:23:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kenapa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.05,0:23:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jika kalian dapat melenyapkan\Nkekuatanku untuk sementara waktu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lenyaplah kau dan seluruh jiwamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu yang lenyap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah terpojok,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kyouraku Shunsui!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu tahu Kageoni?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergilah, Kurosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zangetsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rupanya yang kulihat saat itu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.85,0:24:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah masa depan\Nyang kulihat dengan mataku sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.81,0:24:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir itu mimpi yang kamu perlihatkan padaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Haschwalth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War
